<title>GREECE: Greek/Bund gap widens to 377 bps, 284 vs BTP.</title>
<headline>Greek/Bund gap widens to 377 bps, 284 vs BTP.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The spread of Greece's 10-year bond over bunds rose to 377 basis points today from 365 on Thursday.</p>
<p>The Greek/BTP gap also increased to 284 basis points from 270 on Thursday.</p>
<p>		 CPN     MATURITY  YIELDS    SPREADS    PREVIOUS</p>
<p>								    SPREADS</p>
<p>   GREECE    8.80%   25JUN07    9.32%</p>
<p>   GERMANY   6.0%    04JUL07    5.55%	377	365 bps</p>
<p>   FRANCE    5.5%    25APR07    5.42%	390	379 bps</p>
<p>   ITALY     6.75%   01FEB07    6.48%	284	270 bps</p>
<p>   PORTUGAL  6.63%   23FEB07    6.27%	305	291 bps</p>
<p>   SPAIN     7.35%   31MAR07    6.21%	311	298 bps</p>
<p>   UK	  7.25%   07DEC07    7.22%	210	200 bps</p>
<p>   US	  6.63%   15MAY07    6.35%	297	286 bps</p>
<p>All yields are annualised and based on bid prices at 1155 GMT. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
